@startuml 009-after
' D 도메인: 게임 결과 메시지 리팩토링 후 (#67, 결정 009)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "ui (D)" {
  class LifeFrame <<JFrame>> {
    + LifeFrame(Cell, GameController, Clock)
  }
  interface UserDialogs <<Strategy>> {
    + chooseFile(selectButtonText : String) : File
    + showError(message : String)
    + showMessage(message : String)
  }
  class SwingUserDialogs <<ConcreteStrategy>> {
    + SwingUserDialogs()
    + SwingUserDialogs(messageParent : Component)
  }
  class GameResultAnnouncer <<Observer>> {
    + GameResultAnnouncer(GameController, UserDialogs, Executor)
    + boardChanged(Change)
  }
  class GameMenu
}

package "application (B)" {
  class GameController {
    + addGameListener(GameListener)
    + gameResultMessage() : String
  }
  interface GameListener <<Observer>> {
    + boardChanged(Change)
  }
}

package "javax.swing" {
  class JOptionPane
}

package "test" {
  class RecordingDialogs <<stub>>
}

UserDialogs <|.. SwingUserDialogs
UserDialogs <|.. RecordingDialogs
GameListener <|.. GameResultAnnouncer
GameResultAnnouncer --> UserDialogs : GAME_OVER → showMessage
GameResultAnnouncer --> GameController : gameResultMessage()
GameMenu ..> UserDialogs : Load/Store 오류
SwingUserDialogs ..> JOptionPane
LifeFrame ..> GameResultAnnouncer : 생성·구독 (invokeLater 실행기)
LifeFrame ..> SwingUserDialogs : new SwingUserDialogs(this)
GameController --> GameListener

note right of GameResultAnnouncer
  실행기를 주입받아 테스트는 즉시 실행,
  제품은 SwingUtilities::invokeLater.
end note
@enduml
